Z||000015||qwikgta||11-17-2001||10:21 AM||||You can make your own decklid strut.  84 buick regal hood strut will work, bolt it to you rear most decklid bolt and then attach to the C/C bracket on the driverside rear strut base.  Total cost is under $20.00  <P>Rob<P><BR>This is the only pic that shows the strut, top and bottom at the same time.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/engine1_6.jpg"> <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Sig_Pic_copy.jpg"> ||||reg||1
